  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Pedro Padilla Longoria is a Mexican executive who leads Grupo Salinas and chairs Grupo Elektra. A law graduate of the National Autonomous University of Mexico, he rose through Elektra before running television broadcaster TV Azteca. His own business interests include Loco Tequila, which he co-founded with Gabriel Roqueñi in Mexico.",
    "html": "<p>Pedro Padilla Longoria is a Mexican executive who leads Grupo Salinas and chairs Grupo Elektra. A law graduate of the National Autonomous University of Mexico, he rose through Elektra before running television broadcaster TV Azteca. His own business interests include Loco Tequila, which he co-founded with Gabriel Roqueñi in Mexico.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 50,
